{"type":"message","id":"d4f796d0","parentId":"b435db3a","timestamp":"2026-03-14T01:52:05.216Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The daily memory file for today doesn't exist yet — this is normal on a fresh session. I should create it to capture the system upgrade that was just completed. This is good practice for tracking significant events and changes."},{"type":"toolCall","id":"914435277","name":"write","arguments":{"path":"memory/2026-03-14.md","content":"# 2026-03-14 — System Upgrade Day\n\n## 🎯 Major Update Completed\n\nThe knowledge tracking system has been upgraded to a **Smart Learning & Analysis Engine** with the following features:\n\n### ✅ Spaced Repetition (SRS) Flashcards\n- Answers stored for every gap identified (Benjamin Cowen-style responses)\n- Interactive card flipping on Gaps Dashboard\n- Review scheduling based on repetition logic\n- Tracks progress from \"New\" → \"Review Due\"\n\n### 🔬 Deep Video Analysis & Categorization\n- Auto-generated \"Deep Summary\" for each video\n- Value flagging (🔥 High Value vs Normal)\n- **5 Categories Implemented**:\n  - 📈 ECONOMICS (Macro/Inflation)\n  - ₿ CRYPTO (BTC/Altcoins)\n  - 🧮 MATHEMATICS (Regression/Models)\n  - 🏛️ FED (Interest Rates)\n  - 📊 SP500 (Equities/S&P)\n\n### 📊 Dashboard Enhancements\n- Color-coded category badges\n- Premium Cyberpunk HUD maintained\n- High Value flags clearly displayed\n- Interactive flashcard flipping interface\n\n### 🔄 Files Updated\n- `analyzer.py` — SRS logic + categorization engine\n- `tracker.py` — Deep summary generation\n- `flashcard_history.json` — Review tracking\n- `BOOT.md` — Updated with new system instructions\n\n---\n\n## 📋 Next Steps to Verify:\n1. Visit Gaps Dashboard → test category badges & flashcard flipping\n2. Check Mimic Dashboard → confirm High Value flags display correctly\n3. Run a fresh video analysis → verify categorization works end-to-end\n\n**Status: ✅ System live and synchronized**\n"}}],"api":"openai-comp